data_mote2_product
# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [mote2_product].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# 2H-MoTe2 product-page variant: few-layer material with lattice a = 3.50, c = 13.41 A
# from the referenced product page (reported as a=b=0.350 nm, c=1.341 nm). The Mo-Te bond
# sqrt((a/sqrt(3))^2 + (0.129 c)^2) = 2.66 A, slightly shorter than bulk.
# Validation: mote2-product-structure
